[CONTRACT]
UID: CT-SHARED
STATUS: Proposed
OWNER: Integration
SOURCE: docs/oak/implementation/CONTRACTS.md
SCOPE: Production
VERIFICATION: NotRun
TITLE: Shared envelope and ArtifactRef
STATEMENT: >>>
All service messages use the 0.4.0 envelope. Artifact references carry identity, kind, digest, media type, payload profile, and producer version.
<<<
