[CONTRACT]
UID: CT-STORAGE
STATUS: Proposed
OWNER: Integration
SOURCE: docs/oak/implementation/CONTRACTS.md
SCOPE: Production
VERIFICATION: NotRun
TITLE: Authoritative storage boundaries
STATEMENT: >>>
PostgreSQL owns application records, Neo4j owns domain assertions and atomic ingestion receipts, and immutable files own artifact bytes.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: OAK
  ROLE: OwnedBy

