[CONTRACT]
UID: CT-C4
STATUS: Proposed
OWNER: C4
SOURCE: docs/oak/implementation/C04-execution.md
SCOPE: Production
VERIFICATION: NotRun
TITLE: ExecuteRequest, ActionRequest, ActionResult, CallReceipt, and TrialRecord
STATEMENT: >>>
C4 accepts a typed worker action under a pinned run. Primary paper inference requires a built Gq and exclusive typed F access. The managed fixture extends actions with native response, ingestion, and guarded finalization receipts; those extensions do not establish the primary data boundary.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: C4
  ROLE: OwnedBy
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: CT-SHARED
  ROLE: ConstrainedBy

