[CONTRACT]
UID: CT-AGENT-SHAPE
STATUS: Proposed
OWNER: C8
SOURCE: docs/oak/implementation/AGENT-SHAPE.md
SCOPE: Production
VERIFICATION: NotRun
TITLE: AgentStartingShape and supported loop boundary
STATEMENT: >>>
The strict oak-agent-shape/1 declaration describes the managed engineering profile: task profile, exact native bindings, unresolved kernel port, observed channels, result contract, and bounds. It does not implement the primary paper worker interface. Runtime readiness requires separate server evidence.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: C8
  ROLE: OwnedBy
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: CT-SHARED
  ROLE: ConstrainedBy

[CONTRACT]
UID: CT-CONFORMANCE
STATUS: Proposed
OWNER: C8
SOURCE: docs/oak/implementation/MOUNT-CONFORMANCE.md
SCOPE: Production
VERIFICATION: NotRun
TITLE: Prepared binding and isolated conformance execution
STATEMENT: >>>
A server-only prepared binding permits bounded isolated conformance operations through the existing run ledger. Ordinary task execution requires a ready mount. Conformance cannot recursively require its own completed mount.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: C8
  ROLE: OwnedBy
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: CT-SHARED
  ROLE: ConstrainedBy

